title: "zombienet-sdk-tests: fall back gracefully when CARGO_WORKSPACE_ROOT_DIR is unset"

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      build.rs no longer panics when CARGO_WORKSPACE_ROOT_DIR isn't set (only
      provided via this repo's .cargo/config.toml, absent in some build
      environments). It now falls back to locating the workspace root from
      CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR, which cargo always guarantees.

crates:
  - name: polkadot-zombienet-sdk-tests
    bump: none
